{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな夜中に ろってぃ−だよ？まにだよ？。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/09/9247234/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばいよ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰って来てお風呂上がって洗濯物とかして今。夜中の2時だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく眠い（＾ω＾）わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このblogも途中で寝落ちしちゃうんじゃないか？って位眠いよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/09/9247234/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/09/9247234/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、日曜はまいやんと2人で晩御飯に行ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも又時間が無くて、寿司屋さんに行って今度は5分で口の中に全部詰め込んで店出たよ（＾ω＾）わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でねでね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんにも言ったら驚かれたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ寿司屋さんに行くのがきっと2年ぶりとかなんだよね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪ではよく行ってたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ2年位 行った記憶ない